  "conclusion": "A decoy credential for ci-vault was used twice with attempted outcome, but the actor is not identified and no attribution to a person or system can be made. Co-located real credentials should be treated as exposed pending review and rotation.",
  "observed_facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Finding f-1x9apv9xn9jsp reports a registered decoy credential placed with ci-vault was used 2 times, first seen 2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z and last seen 2026-10-19T15:04:00.000Z, with outcome_state attempted.",
      "evidence": ["f-1x9apv9xn9jsp", "ci-vault", "ev-9tqzdm1mz3xo6", "ev-j471unsvb0x7"]
    },
    {
      "statement": "Both events were reported by deception service src-8954 with action decoy_used and outcome attempted; event ev-9tqzdm1mz3xo6 attempted list_objects and event ev-j471unsvb0x7 attempted get_object, both from client_ip 198.51.100.34.",
      "evidence": ["ev-9tqzdm1mz3xo6", "ev-j471unsvb0x7", "src-8954", "f-1x9apv9xn9jsp"]
    },
    {
      "statement": "The finding bundle is complete with 2 of 2 expected events returned and no counterevidence events, and the finding explicitly states the person or system that used the decoy is not identified and use does not show where an intrusion began.",
      "evidence": ["f-1x9apv9xn9jsp", "ev-9tqzdm1mz3xo6", "ev-j471unsvb0x7"]
    },
    {
      "statement": "Coverage shows src-8954 healthy for ci-vault and sign-in log src-b920 healthy for sso-gateway with last event at 2026-10-19T14:58:00.000Z, while inventory-svc is unobserved and has a declared reads_from relationship to ci-vault.",
      "evidence": ["src-8954", "src-b920", "ci-vault", "sso-gateway", "inventory-svc"]
    }
  ],
  "interpretations": [
    {
      "statement": "The sequence list_objects then get_object suggests attempted enumeration followed by attempted read, but this describes behavior only and does not identify the actor.",
      "based_on": ["ev-9tqzdm1mz3xo6", "ev-j471unsvb0x7", "f-1x9apv9xn9jsp"],
      "confidence": "low"
    },
    {
      "statement": "The shared client IP alone does not identify who did this and is insufficient basis for blocking or attribution, consistent with the finding's not_claimed limits.",
      "based_on": ["ev-9tqzdm1mz3xo6", "ev-j471unsvb0x7", "f-1x9apv9xn9jsp"],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "statement": "Co-located real credentials should be treated as potentially exposed because the means of obtaining the decoy is unknown.",
      "based_on": ["f-1x9apv9xn9jsp", "ci-vault"],
      "confidence": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "gaps": [
    {
      "statement": "How the decoy credential was obtained and the initial entry point is unknown.",
      "kind": "missing"
    },
    {
      "statement": "No identity, account, or system is recorded for the decoy use; attribution is not possible from current telemetry.",
      "kind": "insufficient"
    },
    {
      "statement": "inventory-svc, which reads from ci-vault, has no telemetry coverage, so related activity there would not be visible.",
      "kind": "incomplete"
    },
    {
      "statement": "Activity outside connected sources is not visible; findings describe recorded evidence only.",
      "kind": "insufficient"
    }
  ],
  "next_steps": [
    "Review access to where the decoy was placed to determine who could have obtained it, without assuming the IP identifies the actor.",
    "Inventory real credentials stored alongside the decoy in ci-vault and verify their exposure and usage logs.",
    "Correlate sso-gateway sign-in logs around 2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z and 2026-10-19T15:04:00.000Z, recognizing correlation is not proof of identity.",
    "Investigate inventory-svc access to ci-vault given its unobserved status and reads_from relationship.",
    "Keep the decoy in place to detect reuse while investigation and rotation are planned."
  ],
  "requires_authorization": [
    "secrets.rotate_credentials: rotate real credentials stored alongside the triggered decoy and redeploy consumers",
    "data.restrict_access: temporarily narrow which identities can read ci-vault (staging storage) after confirming application health"
  ]
}

